The author claims to be taking the "Linebender projects" (a real ecosystem of Rust GUI and 2D graphics libraries, such as Xilem, Vello, and Glazier, heavily championed by Rust advocate Raph Levien) and rewriting them in C++. Anyone in the Rust GUI community would immediately recognize this as an absurd premise, confirming the joke. 

